{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0223_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d363479535160c4c87c01ee0817ddb975d6405d1ee5fd019b49c9194b20ae3a4", "ja": "（スケートライブのため、星梨花達とスケート場に\nやってきた。練習は順調に終わり、その帰り道……）", "zh": "（为了滑冰演出，和星梨花她们一起来到了滑冰场。练习顺利结束后，在回去的路上……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0223_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f113f5bff4c0dd282c99001fa48e4fd265b0353b9166134ecd4a4d5c0f596d1b", "ja": "いやぁ……星梨花、スケートすごくうまいんだな。\nちょっとビックリしたよ。", "zh": "哎呀……星梨花，你滑冰滑得真好啊。\n让我有点吃惊呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0223_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "21e7707edd346c25d2c6e0142b7a6a63839bd36cc66495d181d5797544ccb8da", "ja": "えへへ、実はわたし、昔スケートを習ってたんです。\nまだちゃんと滑れて、安心しました♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，其实我以前学过滑冰。还能好好地滑，真是放心了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0223_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "40c7c711b32ddc8d1f2cede177f903ab95e41e1fa533a7356e332a7b52b8fd4a", "ja": "あっ……そうだ！　そのことでわたし、\n{$P$}さんに相談があって……。", "zh": "啊……对了！说到这个，我有件事想找{$P$}先生商量……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0223_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b6e862a792e65451c538baacd064eeccd207d8364773b180f68a88428efaa557", "ja": "相談？　なにかあったのか？", "zh": "找我商量？发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0223_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "c7380c65a1a03342a94855fd2a8feeab8d4853f6ae5abdabf970ecaa7fbc6d46", "ja": "さっき、亜利沙さんと翼さんに、\nスケートを教えて！って言われちゃったんです。", "zh": "刚才，亚利沙和翼突然对我说：“教我们滑冰吧！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0223_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "c18d78249fea7f37d3a5143644cb12368480476173c88b5d1d0279638e69928d", "ja": "でもわたし、普段はみなさんに教わってばかりで、\n何かを教えるのって、どうしたらいいかわからなくて。", "zh": "可是我平时总是在向大家请教，完全不知道该怎么教别人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0223_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "89b0dc33923930fd4277b528c3f5c3122a2c3c5515a2265224c1ed6e454d3b5e", "ja": "次の練習のときに、って言われたんですけど……。\nどうしたら、上手に教えられるんでしょうか？", "zh": "有人跟我说要等下次练习的时候……可是，要怎样才能教得好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0223_1008_p", "source_sha256": "8695667a3557d8fbd6d61301bd288a47cf17a8a665c9ed554c315fc15c2e594e", "ja": "うーん、そうだな……。\nまあ、難しく考える事はないんじゃないか？", "zh": "嗯——这个嘛……\n我觉得没必要想得太复杂吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0223_1009_p", "source_sha256": "198b2514fd2816e81740c2beab967971a63b9daba3d15e26e28e0bbe9b1dc7e7", "ja": "一番大切なのは、ふたりに、スケートが楽しいって\n思ってもらう事だと思うよ。", "zh": "我觉得，最重要的是让两个人觉得滑冰很有趣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0223_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "f5b81076189b670bfa9b1e9929d2c60c02263cb536a729e95d7bc97542859145", "ja": "楽しいと思ってもらう……そっか。\nわたしも習い始めた頃、夢中でやってました！", "zh": "要让她们觉得开心……这样啊。\n我刚开始学习的时候，也曾全心投入过！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0223_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "9e86a59a7bd94aa130e4228a5bbe32a01b1f9045cb3a4a5d10e7b79f1f8ded18", "ja": "楽しいと思える事だから、夢中になれるんですね。\nそれが一番、大切なことなんだ……。", "zh": "正因为是能让人感到快乐的事，所以才能全心投入呢。\n那才是最重要的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0223_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "94c8a8fbcc9e0221dd958006e6f6487af56a2974930672bc771d8b849bf48045", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ありがとうございます。\n楽しく滑る方法なら、たぶん教えられると思います♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，谢谢您。\n如果是让滑行变得开心的方法，我应该还是能教您的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0223_1013_p", "source_sha256": "b8666b45342691721f3661189e99d2d1060d6a93d482faa0f52647a5a118518e", "ja": "ならよかった。\n……っと、遅くなっちゃったな。帰ろう。", "zh": "那就好。\n……糟糕，已经这么晚了。回去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0223_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "016e7a4f69b918d7d6f302ee48a49b66b223bc622062686ddae8d6004caa43af", "ja": "はい！　あと、{$P$}さん。\nこれは、相談じゃなくてお誘いなんですけど。", "zh": "好的！还有，{$P$}先生。\n这个不是来商量，而是想邀请您的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0223_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "900a1f56211b7287ff99baa9afb76d9b703e884853a421ab086537e451913a0b", "ja": "今度は、{$P$}さんも一緒に\nどうですか？　わたし、みんなで一緒に滑りたいです♪", "zh": "下次也一起带上{$P$}先生，怎么样？我想和大家一起滑冰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0223_1016_p", "source_sha256": "9f32b06a5b0142f6971fab513fe6abee5447bcd350249feb73b476cb7bca2c81", "ja": "そうだな……次はそうしようか。\n俺も星梨花先生に、楽しいスケートを教えてもらうよ。", "zh": "是啊……下次就这么办吧。我也请星梨花老师教我享受滑冰的乐趣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0223_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "b55a1b823aa6e2b1dcb363d50e71e1ac9a113a7634b4a826129749967bb5dfda", "ja": "先生……えへへ、任せてくださいっ！　わたしが\nみなさんに、スケートの楽しさを教えちゃいますよ♪", "zh": "老师……嘿嘿，交给我吧！我会让大家感受到滑冰的乐趣哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
